  "content": "# \u2705 Voice Agent Setup Checklist\n\nUse this checklist to ensure everything is set up correctly.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udccb Pre-Flight Checks\n\n- [ ] Python 3.8+ installed (`python --version`)\n- [ ] Internet connection working\n- [ ] Microphone connected (optional but nice)\n- [ ] Speaker working (optional but nice)\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udce6 Installation Checklist\n\n- [ ] Downloaded all files\n- [ ] In the correct directory\n- [ ] Ran: `pip install -r requirements.txt`\n- [ ] Installation completed without errors\n- [ ] Check: `pip list` shows openai, pyttsx3, etc.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd11 API Key Checklist\n\n- [ ] OpenAI account created (https://openai.com)\n- [ ] Visited https://platform.openai.com/api-keys\n- [ ] Created a new secret key\n- [ ] Key copied (starts with `sk-`)\n- [ ] Key stored safely (not in Git!)\n- [ ] Ran: `python setup_agent.py`\n- [ ] Pasted API key when prompted\n- [ ] `.env` file created successfully\n- [ ] `.gitignore` updated (setup does this)\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd27 Configuration Checklist\n\n- [ ] `config.py` reviewed (settings understood)\n- [ ] `.env.example` examined\n- [ ] `.env` file contains `OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...`\n- [ ] No other files contain API keys\n- [ ] `requirements.txt` shows all dependencies\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udfa4 Voice Setup Checklist\n\n- [ ] Microphone recognized by Windows\n- [ ] Volume levels set appropriately\n- [ ] Microphone not muted\n- [ ] Speaker volume set to audible level\n- [ ] No other apps using microphone\n\n---\n\n## \ud83e\uddea First Test Checklist\n\n- [ ] Ran: `python voice_agent.py`\n- [ ] Agent displayed welcome message\n- [ ] Agent spoke the greeting\n- [ ] Chose input mode [1] or [2]\n- [ ] Sent a test message\n- [ ] Agent responded with text\n- [ ] Agent spoke the response\n- [ ] No critical errors in output\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Voice Testing Checklist (Optional)\n\n- [ ] Spoke a sentence into microphone\n- [ ] Agent understood the speech\n- [ ] Agent responded appropriately\n- [ ] Response was spoken aloud\n- [ ] Audio quality acceptable\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcdd Text Mode Testing Checklist (Alternative)\n\n- [ ] Chose Option [2] for text input\n- [ ] Typed a message\n- [ ] Agent responded with text\n- [ ] Response was spoken aloud\n- [ ] Easier than voice mode? (that's OK!)\n\n---\n\n## \ud83e\udde0 Advanced Features Checklist (Optional)\n\n- [ ] Ran: `python voice_agent_advanced.py`\n- [ ] Tried web search: \"Search for Python\"\n- [ ] Tried file read: \"Read QUICK_START.txt\"\n- [ ] Tried file list: \"List files\"\n- [ ] Features working as expected\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcca Monitoring Checklist\n\n- [ ] Checked logs in `logs/voice_agent.log`\n- [ ] Checked conversation history in `agent_data/`\n- [ ] OpenAI API dashboard accessible\n- [ ] Usage appears reasonable\n- [ ] No unexpected charges\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd12 Security Checklist\n\n- [ ] `.env` file is in `.gitignore`\n- [ ] `.env` never committed to Git\n- [ ] API key not visible in code\n- [ ] `MEMORY.md` not containing secrets\n- [ ] No API keys in documentation\n- [ ] `.env` file has restricted permissions\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcda Documentation Checklist\n\n- [ ] Read `START_HERE.md`\n- [ ] Skimmed `QUICK_START.txt`\n- [ ] Know where `GUIDE.md` is located\n- [ ] Know where `README.md` is located\n- [ ] Know where `PROJECT_SUMMARY.md` is located\n\n---\n\n## \u2699\ufe0f Customization Checklist (Optional)\n\n- [ ] Reviewed `config.py` settings\n- [ ] Understood `LLM_MODEL` option\n- [ ] Know how to change voice speed\n- [ ] Know how to enable/disable features\n- [ ] Know how to change system prompt\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\ude80 Ready to Launch?\n\n### Before First Use\n- [ ] All pre-flight checks done\n- [ ] All installation checks done\n- [ ] API key set up\n- [ ] Configuration reviewed\n- [ ] First test successful\n\n### Every Time You Run It\n- [ ] Check `QUICK_START.txt` for commands\n- [ ] Monitor API costs in OpenAI dashboard\n- [ ] Save important conversations (auto-saved)\n- [ ] Enjoy the experience! \ud83d\ude0a\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udc1b Troubleshooting Checklist\n\nIf something isn't working:\n\n- [ ] Check `logs/voice_agent.log` for errors\n- [ ] Review `GUIDE.md` troubleshooting section\n- [ ] Verify API key is set correctly\n- [ ] Check internet connection\n- [ ] Test with text input (avoids microphone issues)\n- [ ] Verify OpenAI API status\n- [ ] Read error messages carefully\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcde Support Checklist\n\nIf you need help:\n\n- [ ] Checked `QUICK_START.txt`\n- [ ] Checked `GUIDE.md`\n- [ ] Checked `README.md`\n- [ ] Reviewed `PROJECT_SUMMARY.md`\n- [ ] Checked OpenAI docs: https://platform.openai.com/docs\n- [ ] Checked OpenAI status: https://status.openai.com\n\n---\n\n## \u2728 Congratulations!\n\nIf you've checked all the boxes, your Voice Agent is ready to use!\n\n### Next Steps\n1. Run: `python voice_agent.py`\n2. Choose input mode\n3. Start talking! \ud83c\udf99\ufe0f\n\n### Have Fun!\nTry asking interesting questions and see what your AI assistant can do.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udca1 Tips for Success\n\n- **Start simple**: Begin with basic questions\n- **Use text mode**: If microphone is unreliable\n- **Monitor costs**: Check OpenAI dashboard regularly\n- **Save conversations**: They're auto-saved to `agent_data/`\n- **Try advanced agent**: For web search and file ops\n- **Experiment**: Try different questions and interactions\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udf93 Learning Resources\n\n- OpenAI API Docs: https://platform.openai.com/docs\n- Python Docs: https://docs.python.org/3/\n- pyttsx3 Docs: https://pyttsx3.readthedocs.io/\n- GitHub for examples: https://github.com\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcdd Notes Section\n\nUse this space for your own notes:\n\n```\nSetup Date: _______________\nAPI Key Status: _______________\nPreferred Input Mode: [1] Voice / [2] Text\nFavorite Feature: _______________\nIssues Encountered: _______________\nSolutions Found: _______________\n```\n\n---\n\n## \u2705 Final Check\n\n- [ ] Everything works\n- [ ] Documentation is clear\n- [ ] Ready to proceed\n- [ ] Excited to use the agent! \ud83c\udf89\n\n---\n\n**Status**: Ready for deployment! \ud83d\ude80\n\nNow run:\n```bash\npython voice_agent.py\n```\n\nAnd enjoy! \ud83c\udf99\ufe0f\u2728\n"
}
