irements.txt\n3. Setup: python setup_agent.py\n4. Run: python voice_agent.py\n```\n\n### 2\ufe0f\u20e3 Need Help?\n\n```\nQuestion about...          Read this...\nSetup & installation       START_HERE.md or GUIDE.md\nFeatures & usage          README.md or GUIDE.md\nConfiguration             config.py or PROJECT_SUMMARY.md\nAPI costs                 GUIDE.md or PROJECT_SUMMARY.md\nTroubleshooting           GUIDE.md (has full section)\nSecurity                  GUIDE.md or PROJECT_SUMMARY.md\nTechnical details         PROJECT_SUMMARY.md\n```\n\n### 3\ufe0f\u20e3 Advanced Users\n\n```\nWant to...                See...\nCustomize agent           config.py and voice_agent.py\nAdd features             PROJECT_SUMMARY.md (Future Ideas)\nUnderstand architecture  PROJECT_SUMMARY.md\nConfigure costs          config.py and GUIDE.md\nDeploy agent             README.md and GUIDE.md\n```\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcc2 File Organization\n\n```\nworkspace/\n\u2502\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 \ud83c\udf99\ufe0f MAIN AGENTS\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 voice_agent.py              (Start here!)\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 voice_agent_advanced.py      (Advanced version)\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 setup_agent.py               (Run this first)\n\u2502\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 \u2699\ufe0f CONFIGURATION\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 config.py                    (Settings)\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 requirements.txt             (Dependencies)\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 .env.example                 (Template)\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 .gitignore                   (Security)\n\u2502\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 \ud83d\udcda DOCUMENTATION\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 START_HERE.md               \u2190 READ FIRST (5 min)\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 OVERVIEW.txt                (Summary)\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 QUICK_START.txt             (Reference card)\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 README.md                   (Full docs)\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 GUIDE.md                    (Detailed guide)\n\u2502   \