{
  "content": "# \ud83c\udf99\ufe0f START HERE - Voice Agent Setup\n\nWelcome! This file will guide you through getting your Voice Agent up and running in **less than 5 minutes**.\n\n---\n\n## \u26a1 The 3-Step Quick Start\n\n### Step 1: Install (1 minute)\n```bash\npip install -r requirements.txt\n```\n\u2705 Done! All Python packages installed.\n\n### Step 2: Configure (2 minutes)\n```bash\npython setup_agent.py\n```\nThis will:\n- Ask for your OpenAI API key\n- Save it securely\n- Verify everything is ready\n\n**Don't have an API key?**\n\u2192 Visit: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys\n\u2192 Create a new secret key (free $5 credit)\n\u2192 Paste it when prompted\n\n### Step 3: Run (1 minute)\n```bash\npython voice_agent.py\n```\n\ud83d\udcac Start talking to your AI!\n\n---\n\n## \u2705 That's It!\n\nYou now have a working voice agent. Here's what you can do:\n\n### Basic Usage\n1. **Speak naturally** - \"What is Python?\"\n2. **Agent responds** - It will answer and speak back\n3. **Continue conversation** - Type or speak again\n4. **Exit** - Type \"quit\" or \"exit\"\n\n### Interaction Mode\nWhen you run the agent, it asks:\n- `[1] Voice input` - Speak into microphone\n- `[2] Text input` - Type your message\n- `[3] Quit` - Exit\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcda Documentation Guide\n\n**Choose what you need:**\n\n| If You Want | Read |\n|-------------|------|\n| Quick reference | `QUICK_START.txt` |\n| Detailed guide | `GUIDE.md` |\n| Full documentation | `README.md` |\n| Project overview | `PROJECT_SUMMARY.md` |\n| Configuration options | `config.py` |\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\ude80 Next Steps\n\n### Immediate (After Step 3)\n- [ ] Run the agent\n- [ ] Test with a simple question\n- [ ] Say \"quit\" to exit\n\n### Short Term\n- [ ] Read `QUICK_START.txt` (5 min)\n- [ ] Explore configuration in `config.py`\n- [ ] Try the advanced agent: `python voice_agent_advanced.py`\n\n### Medium Term\n- [ ] Customize the system prompt (in `voice_agent.py`)\n- [ ] Switch to `gpt-3.5-turbo` for cheaper operation\n- [ ] Add custom voice (change voice properties)\n- [ ] Monitor API usage in OpenAI dashboard\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udca1 Tips\n\n**Faster responses?**\n\u2192 Edit `config.py`, change `LLM_MODEL = \"gpt-3.5-turbo\"`\n\n**Save money?**\n\u2192 Use text input instead of voice (Option 2)\n\u2192 Use gpt-3.5-turbo instead of gpt-4\n\n**Microphone not working?**\n\u2192 Use text input (Option 2) for now\n\u2192 Check Windows volume settings\n\n**API key lost?**\n\u2192 Run `python setup_agent.py` again\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcc1 Project Structure\n\n```\nvoice_agent/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 voice_agent.py              \u2190 Run this to start\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 voice_agent_advanced.py      \u2190 More features\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 setup_agent.py               \u2190 Configuration\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 config.py                    \u2190 Settings\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 START_HERE.md               \u2190 You are here\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 QUICK_START.txt             \u2190 Quick reference\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 GUIDE.md                    \u2190 Detailed guide\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 README.md                   \u2190 Full docs\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 requirements.txt            \u2190 Dependencies\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 .env                        \u2190 Your API key (created by setup)\n```\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udd98 Troubleshooting\n\n### \"OPENAI_API_KEY not set\"\n\u2192 Run: `python setup_agent.py`\n\n### \"No module named 'openai'\"\n\u2192 Run: `pip install -r requirements.txt`\n\n### \"Microphone not detected\"\n\u2192 Use Option 2 (text input)\n\u2192 Check Windows volume settings\n\n### \"No response from agent\"\n\u2192 Check internet connection\n\u2192 Check OpenAI API status: https://status.openai.com\n\n### More issues?\n\u2192 Read `GUIDE.md` (has detailed troubleshooting)\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udfaf What The Agent Can Do\n\n### Basic Version (`voice_agent.py`)\n\u2705 Have conversations\n\u2705 Answer questions\n\u2705 Understand context\n\u2705 Remember previous messages\n\n### Advanced Version (`voice_agent_advanced.py`)\n\u2705 All of the above, plus:\n\u2705 Web search\n\u2705 Read and write files\n\u2705 List directories\n\u2705 Save conversation logs\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcb0 Cost Information\n\n### Free\n- Setup: FREE\n- Documentation: FREE\n- Python libraries: FREE\n\n### OpenAI API\n- **Free trial**: $5 credit (usually 3 months)\n- **After**: ~$0.10-0.20 per minute\n- **With gpt-3.5-turbo**: ~$0.01-0.02 per minute\n\n### Money-Saving Tips\n1. Use `gpt-3.5-turbo` instead of `gpt-4`\n2. Use text input instead of voice\n3. Set up billing alerts in OpenAI dashboard\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd10 Security Reminder\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f **Your API Key**\n- Never share it\n- Never commit .env to Git (already protected)\n- If exposed, regenerate immediately\n\nSee the full guide for security details.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcde Getting Help\n\n1. **Quick answers**: Check `QUICK_START.txt`\n2. **Detailed help**: Read `GUIDE.md`\n3. **How things work**: Check `README.md`\n4. **Specific errors**: Look in `logs/voice_agent.log`\n5. **OpenAI issues**: Visit https://status.openai.com\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udf93 Understanding the Architecture\n\n```\nYou speak/type\n    \u2193\n[Input processed]\n    \u2193\n[Sent to OpenAI GPT-4]\n    \u2193\n[AI generates response]\n    \u2193\n[Converted to speech]\n    \u2193\nAgent speaks back\n```\n\nSimple and powerful!\n\n---\n\n## \u2699\ufe0f Customization\n\n### Change the voice personality\nEdit `voice_agent.py` \u2192 Look for `system_prompt`\n\n### Change the voice speed\nEdit `config.py` \u2192 Change `VOICE_RATE` (100-300)\n\n### Use cheaper model\nEdit `config.py` \u2192 Change `LLM_MODEL = \"gpt-3.5-turbo\"`\n\n### Enable/disable features\nEdit `config.py` \u2192 Change `ENABLE_*` settings\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udfc1 Ready to Start?\n\nRun these commands in order:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Install dependencies (if not done yet)\npip install -r requirements.txt\n\n# 2. Configure your API key\npython setup_agent.py\n\n# 3. Start the agent\npython voice_agent.py\n```\n\nThen just **talk naturally** to your AI assistant! \ud83c\udf99\ufe0f\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcd6 Recommended Reading Order\n\n1. **You are here** \u2192 `START_HERE.md` (2 min)\n2. **Quick reference** \u2192 `QUICK_START.txt` (5 min)\n3. **Detailed guide** \u2192 `GUIDE.md` (15 min)\n4. **Full docs** \u2192 `README.md` (20 min)\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udf1f Have Fun!\n\nYou're about to experience the future of human-computer interaction. Enjoy talking to your AI assistant!\n\nQuestions? Check the documentation or run `python setup_agent.py` for help.\n\n---\n\n**Last updated**: 2024\n**Version**: 1.0\n**Status**: Ready to use! \ud83d\ude80\n",
  "lines": 277
}
